  Default locale = Traditional Chinese (zh-TW). English lives in values-en/.

  Every user-visible string of the app is defined here. The Kotlin sources must
  never inline a literal, because a literal cannot be translated; the enum
  names in data/*.kt are a STORAGE format (Room rows, DataStore values) and are
  therefore mapped to these strings, never replaced by them.
